    distills: "The lexicon gains 'not answering' - said of the control API and never of the proxy, since capture health and transport health are different facts - and display-equals-payload's OK example loses the pair that illustrated the very form the lexicon forbids. NO rule amendment: no predicate, slug or tier moves. Nothing either design run escalated argued a rule was wrong rather than a design, so DEC-14's provision for rulebook growth at distillation went unused."
  - path: docs/backlog/roadmap.html
